You will want to use KDJ11 based CPUs:

  M8192 11/73 dual height card
    uses any MSV11-xx memory

  M8190 11/83 quad height card
    prefer MSV11-Jx (PMI) memory
    can use any MSV11-xx memory

  M8981 11/93 quad height card
    2 versions: 2MB or 4 MB on card
    cannot use any external memory

