> So what cards should I put into that one box?
> 
> M7555 vs M8639

M7555 RQDX3

> RD54 vs older, smaller disks

RD54, RD53, RD31, RD32. Any will work with RQDX3

> DELQA Ethrenet vs DEQNA

DELQA, has DEQNA lock mode if ever needed

> TK70 vs some old floppy drive

both. 8-) The TK70 system makes backups easier, IMHO.

