I just thought I would offer up some information for you. There are
two different CI adapters you can use in this configuration. Both
require a minimum VMS V6.2-1H3. The first is the CIPCA-AA this is a
PCI based CI adapter and requires 1 EISA and 1 PCI slot and also one
CI cable (BNCIA-xx)per adapter. The second is the CIPCA-BA this is a
PCI based CI adapter and requires 2 PCI slots and also one CI cable
(BNCIA-xx)per adapter. The CIPCA-AA sells for about $900, The CIPCA-BA
sells for about $3700. The cables pricing varies depending on the
length you require. They come in lengths of 10, 20 and 45 meters.

Have fun!

